WEBVTT

00:01:58.746 --> 00:02:01.704
and the shrinking
of your prefrontal cortex,

00:02:01.746 --> 00:02:06.079
that part of your brain that regulates
behaviors such as concentration,

00:02:06.121 --> 00:02:08.538
decision making, jugement,

00:02:08.579 --> 00:02:10.663
and social interaction.

00:02:10.829 --> 00:02:14.954
This leads to a decrease in the number
of cells produced by the hippocampus,

00:02:14.996 --> 00:02:20.288
which means that chronic stress makes
learning and remembering more difficult.

00:02:20.454 --> 00:02:23.579
It also paves the way
to more serious mental problems

00:02:23.621 --> 00:02:27.788
such as depression
and Alzheimer’s disease.

00:02:28.204 --> 00:02:32.413
The effects of stress can even
seep into the DNA of your brain.